Cell["\<\
The surface of a tube is the band profile {2, 2}: the vertices at distance \
exactly 2 from the axis vertex they project to.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"d4a1e9a4-8b8d-486c-8c2a-fcea84039a56"],

